[{"client_msg_id":"a13d7927-3155-42aa-b85d-6cf81ef1b8d3","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"これ「安全側に倒した」的な言い訳で終わってそう。","ts":"1634188544.100500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lsDlI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36c494dc-ea8e-4efc-b4a4-c1b1c132e9c0","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"いずれにせよその後のアプリ側の処理もなかなか最悪なんですが","ts":"1634187888.099800","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1634187899.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ejCc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c49620ab-e7e9-4943-8ed4-3c53c009b9a7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"APIが返すエラーが適切ではなかった or アプリのエラー処理が適切ではなかったためにエンドポイントのエラーをロックされたと誤認してしまった、という感じですかねえ","ts":"1634187840.099300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mUT/Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79904990-8550-4397-814B-0632B6E3A76A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"結局はエラーメッセージが適切ではない系か","ts":"1634187748.097700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ji4A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64606587-7dca-4220-8e27-3cdf87b16ce8","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ、私用かつセキュア操作するのは1つだけにしてる、とかはあるかもしれないので、そこもしゃーないかなという気もする(他ので読めるかくらいはやってもいいのに、とは思うけど)","ts":"1634186636.097200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CWZAJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7e321b4e-4c3e-4bbf-8545-93cf47e37e02","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"Impressの人は持ってるやろとは思う。","ts":"1634186576.096400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yuy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6eb731e-2114-448a-9677-8789514b2b3f","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ただし普通の人は端末何個も持ってないんですよ……。","ts":"1634186526.096000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"nandato","count":1,"users":["U01D44KSY9Z"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"flqDZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d5917a6-dfe0-43ed-9a3a-06dc203a498f","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"役所でやってることは端末替えて作業してるのと同じことだと思うので。\nそうなるんじゃないかなと。","ts":"1634186509.095600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tavw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aa4d33e1-ef8b-4bf1-a04d-7a2b18437a2c","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"この人含めこの問題にぶつかった人がまったく試してないとも思えないので別の問題っぽい気もしますが","ts":"1634185472.095000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KeH+g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ee7fe2a-ce2f-406b-9552-f861c96c59a0","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"この推測通りの場合は端末を変更したら通る気がする","ts":"1634185364.093700","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1634185375.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ecc9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"529cb19c-d8a1-4070-a7f0-00578749e39d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"単純なAPIのエラーをロックされたと思い込んでブルートフォース対策のために端末側でキャッシュして以降は「ロックされた」ことにしてリクエストを送らないようにしている\nみたいな推測を立てた","ts":"1634185258.093300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"clE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0CA8B6D4-FBEC-4615-9E2C-9808198C5ADF","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"これは……\n\u003chttps://www.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/1357560.html|https://www.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/1357560.html\u003e","ts":"1634183917.091600","attachments":[{"fallback":"Impress Watch: マイナンバーカードの暗証番号がロックされた。役所に行ったら……","id":1,"title":"マイナンバーカードの暗証番号がロックされた。役所に行ったら……","title_link":"https://www.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/1357560.html","text":"マイナンバーカードの暗証番号がロックされました。しかも、ロックされた原因が全くわかりません。","image_url":"https://www.watch.impress.co.jp/img/ipw/list/1357/560/mnb_01.jpg","blocks":null,